{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"苏轼·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<p>本 hub 聚焦苏轼（1037–1101）的<strong>思想内核与方法论</strong>——他用什么人生哲学面对苦难、用什么思想资源安顿身心、用什么艺术观贯通诗书画。这是苏轼之所以成为苏轼的&quot;操作系统&quot;，而非他的生平履历或具体作品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>苏轼专题下有六个 hub，本 hub 是其中讲&quot;为什么这样想、这样做&quot;的一个，与其他五个分工明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>：发生了什么（贬谪轨迹、乌台诗案等史实）——本 hub 用作思想的背景坐标，不重述。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：他在文、词、思想上的成就<strong>是什么</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>思想与方法（本 hub）</strong>：支撑上述一切的<strong>人生哲学与艺术观</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作</a>：思想落地为哪些<strong>具体作品</strong>（《赤壁赋》《寒食帖》等）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>：这些思想对后世的塑造。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：党争立场与历史评价的分歧。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：别处讲&quot;做了什么、写了什么&quot;，本 hub 讲&quot;凭什么这样活、这样创作&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>回答的核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 <a href=\"transcending-adversity/\">逆境中的旷达</a></td>\n<td>面对苦难的态度与心法</td>\n<td>怎样在绝境中不崩溃？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 <a href=\"the-three-teachings/\">三教融通</a></td>\n<td>儒释道的思想资源整合</td>\n<td>旷达的思想根基从何而来？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 <a href=\"art-and-spontaneity/\">艺术与自然</a></td>\n<td>贯通诗书画的艺术总原则</td>\n<td>这套哲学如何投射到创作？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先了解 <a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/\">生平·贬谪生涯</a> 的基本史实，再读本 hub，旷达才有具体依托。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐顺序</strong>：第 1 章（现象：旷达是什么）→ 第 2 章（根源：旷达从何而来）→ 第 3 章（外化：旷达如何成为艺术）。三章构成&quot;现象—根源—外化&quot;的递进，逆序阅读会丢失因果链条。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transcending-adversity","title":"Transcending Adversity","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/transcending-adversity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"equanimity-in-hardship","title":"逆境中的旷达","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/transcending-adversity/equanimity-in-hardship"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-art-of-contentment","title":"安顿身心的智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/transcending-adversity/the-art-of-contentment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-three-teachings","title":"The Three Teachings","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"confucian-engagement","title":"儒者的担当","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings/confucian-engagement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"buddhist-daoist-transcendence","title":"佛道的超脱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings/buddhist-daoist-transcendence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"art-and-spontaneity","title":"Art And Spontaneity","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scholar-painting","title":"文人画的精神","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity/scholar-painting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"naturalness-in-art","title":"自然天成的艺术观","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity/naturalness-in-art"}]}]}